  "body": "### Use case\r\n\r\nWhen you forget to \"reply\" to a specific message it would be useful to edit the message and attach the reply.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/vector-im/element-meta/issues/1047 for ideas/interest in this feature in Element.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Proposal\r\n\r\nNothing needs to change spec-wise except for the language to allow it (as far as I know).\r\n\r\nThis already technically works in Synapse/Element after https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-react-sdk/pull/6817\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nRelated to retroactive threading\r\n\r\n\r\n### Prior art\r\n\r\n[MSC2676](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2676) already explicitly calls out that this is not allowed:\r\n\r\n - https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/blob/main/proposals/2676-message-editing.md#applying-mnew_content\r\n - https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/blob/main/proposals/2676-message-editing.md#edits-of-replies\r\n \r\nThere was [some discussion on the MSC](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2676#discussion_r696791776) to allow for this but it was punted to a future proposal",
